<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Enron cut by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Enron cut by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it removed Enron Corp from the priority list.</p>
<p>-- said kept Enron on the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, Enron cut its forecast for 1997 earnings by $0.30 per share to about $2.25 on a primary earnings per share basis.</p>
<p>-- Enron lost 3/4 to 38-1/4.</p>
</text>
